src/ink/index.ts (unchanged exports; only the doc comments were updated):
- InkProvider({ children, childId?, recognizer?, penSeen? }) — `penSeen` (new) forces palm-rejection state for tests and the gallery and is not saved.
- useInputMode() → { mode, setPreferred, isTouchDevice, penSeen, preference, forgetPen }
- useRecognizer() → { ready, recognize | null }
- useInkLearning() → { confirm(), discard(), recognitionFixes() }
- DigitCell(DigitCellProps & { cellId?, showClear?, className? }) — onChange's second argument is InkChangeInfo { confidence, via, recognitionFix? }
- NumberInput(NumberInputProps & { ariaLabel?, className?, keypadToggle?, keypadPosition?: 'below' | 'right' }) — `keypadPosition` is new.
- Keypad, CellGroup, CalibrationFlow({ childId, companionName, onDone, repeats? }) — samples are now stored for `childId` — and TraceDigit({ digit, onDone({ stars, score }) }).
- Type exports unchanged: InkChangeInfo, InkVia, CellGroupProps, CellOrder, KeypadProps, InkLearning, InputModeState.
- Internal additions: policy.msSincePenContact(), CaptureCallbacks.onBlockedWrite, CellGroupApi.nudgeKeypad(), learning.selectSamples(), LearningStore.calibration(digit, rec, childId?), Nudge.tsx (useNudge, NudgeBubble).
